CeladonCity_SurfHouse_Text_NoraOffer::
    .string "I keep Electric POKéMON where the city\n"
    .string "stays quiet. One of them left me this\l"
    .string "EGG, but I don't have room to raise\l"
    .string "another youngster. Would you take it?$"

CeladonCity_SurfHouse_Text_NoraDecline::
    .string "All right. The EGG is safe here until\n"
    .string "you're ready.$"

CeladonCity_SurfHouse_Text_NoraSuccess::
    .string "Take good care of it. There's a lot of\n"
    .string "energy in that shell.$"

CeladonCity_SurfHouse_Text_NoraNoRoom::
    .string "You don't have anywhere safe for the\n"
    .string "EGG right now. Make room in your party\l"
    .string "or PC and come back.$"

CeladonCity_SurfHouse_Text_NoraPostClaim::
    .string "When it hatches, let it see more than\n"
    .string "this little shore.$"
